--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party material
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository vendors third-party design references under
`fde-toolkit/plugins/fde-core/vendor/`. Each is pinned to an immutable
upstream commit and imported as data, not as executable code. Per-source
provenance — upstream URL, pinned commit, SPDX identifier, imported paths,
and the SHA-256 of every file — is recorded in
`fde-toolkit/plugins/fde-core/vendor/design-sources.lock.json` and can be
re-verified with `vendor/bin/design-sources audit`.

