--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Vendored plugins
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository also vendors two third-party plugins under
`fde-toolkit/plugins/`. Unlike the design references above they contain agent
guidance or executable code. Each is pinned to an immutable upstream commit,
imported as a reviewed subset, and its provenance — upstream URL, tag or ref,
commit, licence, imported paths, and the SHA-256 of every file — is recorded in
the lock file beside its manifest. Re-verify them at any time with
`fde plugins verify`.

4. code-simplifier
   https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-official
   Copyright Anthropic PBC
   Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
   Pinned at commit da823e86c8feef13b73b6712af11eadd38c992f6.
   Full text: fde-toolkit/plugins/code-simplifier/LICENSE
   Provenance: fde-toolkit/plugins/code-simplifier/.claude-plugin/fde-lock.json
   Imported: the plugin manifest and code-simplifier agent definition. No
   hooks, executables, install scripts or runtime dependencies are present.

5. ponytail
   https://github.com/dietrichgebert/ponytail
   Copyright (c) 2026 DietrichGebert
   Licensed under the MIT License.
   Pinned at v4.9.0, commit 356918eba965ee1eac64bd3a7f0dd02108350de5.
   Full text: fde-toolkit/plugins/ponytail/LICENSE
   Provenance: fde-toolkit/plugins/ponytail/.claude-plugin/fde-lock.json
   Imported: the plugin manifest, six skills, six commands, three lifecycle
   hooks and the JavaScript modules they require. Not imported: artwork,
   benchmarks, tests, translated READMEs, the MCP server, and the packaging
   for other agents.

